~tc~Up to date as of Wed Jan  4 23:48:12 UTC 2006 (date on the mooix server).  Check for new stuff using:
ls -lrt $(find /var/lib/mooix /usr/lib/mooix -type f -name '*.cmd.jbo') | tail
~/tc~
! Movement Commands

;go through an exit:klama [[exit] (i.e. "klama le stici" to go west)
;go to your home:zdakla/klama le zdani
;list the exits out of the room you are in:ma pluta

! Communication Commands

;say out loud:cusku lu ... li'u/cusku "..." OR just "...
;say to someone (others can hear you, though):cusku lu ... li'u [[name]/cusku "..." [[name]
;perform an action, assume a pose:jarco lu ...li'u/jarco "..."  OR just :...
;pray to the gods (use to ask for help or request creation of something):ceirpikci/cevypikci lu...li'u

! Interaction Commands

;list your inventory:ponse/ralte ma
;look around the room:viska
;look at an object:viska [[object]/catlu [[object]
;pick up/take an object:cpacu/lebna/ponse/ralte [[object]
;drop an object:falgau [[object] or [[object] farlu
;put an object on/under/behind/in another object:[[object] cu cpana/cnita/trixe/nenri/se vasru [[object]
;look on top of/under/behind/in an object:ma cpana/cnita/trixe/nenri/se vasru [[object]
;put an object somewhere:punji [[object] [[object] (defaults to cpana)/punji [[object]] le nenri/cpana/cnita/trixe be [[object]
;put an object somewhere:[[object] cu klama [[object] (defaults to cpana)/[[object]] cu klama le nenri/cpana/cnita/trixe be [[object]
;put an object inside/beneath another object:setca/nitygau [[object] [[object]
;close a container or a door:[[object] cu ganlo
;open a container or a door:[[object] cu kalri
;offer something to someone:friti [[object] [[user]j
;attack something:gunta [[object]
;attack something with a weapon:[[weapon] xarci/tunta/janli [[target] or darxi [[target] [[weapon]
;wield a weapon:jgari [[weapon]
;throw an object:renro [[object] [[target: optional]
;put on clothes:dasni [[object]
;lie down on a bed:vreta [[object: optional]
;sit on a piece of furniture:zutse [[object: optional]
;stand up:sanli
;stand on a piece of furniture:sanli [[object]]
;use a consumable object:xakygau [[object]
;teleport an object somwhere:[[object] cu zvati [[location]
;teleport an object to your location:[[object] cu zvati ti
;teleport an object to yourself:[[object] cu zvati mi

! Miscellaneous Commands

;change your password:mipri
;get help:sidju
;get help in any language:mulsidju
;get help on a particular topic:sidju/mulsidju fi "[[topic]"
;get a list of all help topics:sidju/mulsidju fi "liste"
;quit/leave:sipna/sisti
;who's online:ma cikna
;list languages:selbau ma
;select a language:selbau [[language]
;rename something:lu [[name] li'u/"[[name]" cu cmene [[object]
;set something's description:skicu [[object] fo "[[description]"
;set your home to your current location:(ti/le se zvati be mi/etc) zdani mi
;set a field to true (1):fa "[[field]" po [[object] cu jetnu
;set a field to false (0):fa "[[field]" po [[object] cu na jetnu
;set a field to false (0):fa "[[field]" po [[object] cu jitfa
;make a shortcut to an object:lu [[short name] li'u tcita [[object]
;remove a shortcut to an object:no da tcita [[object]
;list your shortcuts:tcita

! Builder/Advanced Commands

;edit a field on yourself ("name" and "description" are common choices):galfi "[[field]" po mi
;edit a field on another object ("name" and "description" are common choices):galfi "[[field]" po [[object name]
;editing in another language:galfi "[[field]" po [[object name] bau la [[language]
;set a field:fa "[[field]" po [[object] cu binxo lu [[setting] li'u/"[[setting]"
;set a field in another language:fa "[[field]" po [[object] cu binxo lu [[setting] li'u/"[[setting]" bau la [[language]
;unset/remove a field:vimcu "[[field]" [[object]
;turn on logging:vreji
;display your log (thus erasing it):ma fasnu
;destroy an object:daspo [[object]
;create an object:finti "[[name]"/lu [[name] li'u fo [[class]
;list classes:finti fo ma/jutsi/klesi
;list objects you've created:finti ma
;list objects others have created:[[user] finti ma
;show lots of information about an object (show):lanli [[ojbect] [[field: optional]/ckaji [[object] ma
;show ''lots'' of information about an object (showall):tcelanli [[ojbect] [[field: optional]
;dig a room with exits:le cliva ce'o le xruti cu pluta le kumfa ti
;dig a room without exits:pluta le kumfa ti
;dig a exits to an existing room:le cliva ce'o le xruti cu pluta la'o zoi mooix:portfolio/kumfa zoi ti
;list a field or a method:catlu "[[field/method]" po [[object]
;get usage/detailed information on an object:ma plitadji fi [[object]]
;get usage/detailed information on a field or method:ma plitadji fi "[[field/method]" po [[object]
;reparent an object:[[class] cu rirni [[object]
;set a field's UNIX permission mode:zifre fa "[[field]]" po [[object name] li [[mode number]
;run a shell command:samyminde "[[command]" OR just !...
;run a piece of Perl code in the mooix code environment:samyrucygau "[[code]" OR just ;...
